WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The valuation screen introduces AutoValue AI and its use of historical vehicle data.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:43.000
The vehicle form contains model year, status, make, model, mileage, and a prediction interval. The recording selects an example and edits its details.

3
00:00:43.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Submitting example vehicles returns historical asking-price estimates and calibrated intervals. The result identifies RF05 and the 2023 asking-price target.

4
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:27.000
The recording opens the ML engineering dashboard, which describes the frozen model and its evaluation.

5
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:45.366
The dashboard shows interval coverage, system architecture, and experiment history. River online learning is shown as separate shadow research.
